# local env files
# `.env` holds the Supabase project URL and publishable key. The publishable key
# is safe in a client binary — RLS is what protects the data, not key secrecy —
# but it stays out of git so that the day a secret key exists, the pathway for
# it is already safe. `.env.example` documents the shape and is committed.
.env
.env*.local
!.env.example

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
